  "id": "blueberry-lemon-loaf",
  "name": "Blueberry Lemon Loaf",
  "subtitle": "A tender citrus loaf studded with blueberries",
  "description": "A lightly sweet loaf combining lemon, creamy dairy, and frozen blueberries in a simple baked batter.",
